msgid "<b>WARNING: openpilot longitudinal control is in alpha for this car and may disable Automatic Emergency Braking (AEB).</b><br><br>On this car, openpilot defaults to the car's built-in ACC instead of openpilot's longitudinal control. Enable this to switch to openpilot longitudinal control. Enabling Experimental mode is recommended when enabling openpilot longitudinal control alpha. Changing this setting will restart openpilot if the car is powered on."
msgstr "<b>警告：此车型的 openpilot 纵向控制处于 alpha 阶段，可能会停用自动紧急制动 (AEB)。</b><br><br>在此车型上，openpilot 默认使用车辆内置 ACC，而非 openpilot 的纵向控制。启用此项可切换为 openpilot 纵向控制。启用 openpilot 纵向控制 alpha 时，建议同时开启实验模式。若车辆已通电，更改此设置将重启 openpilot。"

msgid "Standard is recommended. In aggressive mode, openpilot will follow lead cars closer and be more aggressive with the gas and brake. In relaxed mode openpilot will stay further away from lead cars. On supported cars, you can cycle through these personalities with your steering wheel distance button."
msgstr "推荐使用标准模式。在激进模式下，openpilot 会更近地跟随前车，并在油门和刹车上更为激进。在从容模式下，openpilot 会与前车保持更远的距离。在支持的车型上，可通过方向盘上的跟车距离按键循环切换这些风格。"

msgid ""
"Use caution when installing third-party software.\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ It has not been tested by comma.\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ It may not comply with relevant safety standards.\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ It may cause damage to your device and/or vehicle.\n"
"\n"
"If you'd like to proceed, use https://flash.comma.ai to restore your device to a factory state later.\n"
msgstr ""
"安装第三方软件时请谨慎。\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ 它未经 comma 测试。\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ 它可能不符合相关安全标准。\n"
"\n"
"⚠️ 它可能损坏您的设备和/或车辆。\n"
"\n"
"如果您希望继续，之后可使用 https://flash.comma.ai 将设备恢复到出厂状态。\n"

msgid "openpilot defaults to driving in chill mode. Experimental mode enables alpha-level features that aren't ready for chill mode. Experimental features are listed below:<br><h4>End-to-End Longitudinal Control</h4><br>Let the driving model control the gas and brakes. openpilot will drive as it thinks a human would, including stopping for red lights and stop signs. Since the driving model decides the speed to drive, the set speed will only act as an upper bound. This is an alpha quality feature; mistakes should be expected.<br><h4>New Driving Visualization</h4><br>The driving visualization will transition to the road-facing wide-angle camera at low speeds to better show some turns. The Experimental mode logo will also be shown in the top right corner."
msgstr "openpilot 默认以轻松模式驾驶。实验模式会启用尚未准备好用于轻松模式的 alpha 级功能。实验性功能如下：<br><h4>端到端纵向控制</h4><br>让驾驶模型控制油门和刹车。openpilot 会像人类那样驾驶，包括在红灯和停车标志前停车。由于行驶速度由驾驶模型决定，设定速度仅作为上限。这是 alpha 品质的功能，可能会出现失误。<br><h4>全新驾驶可视化</h4><br>驾驶可视化会在低速时切换到面向道路的广角摄像头，以更好地显示某些弯道。实验模式标志也会显示在右上角。"

msgid ""
"openpilot learns to drive by watching humans, like you, drive.\n"
"\n"
"Firehose Mode allows you to maximize your training data uploads to improve openpilot's driving models. More data means bigger models, which means better Experimental Mode."
msgstr ""
"openpilot 通过观察人类（例如您）驾驶来学习开车。\n"
"\n"
"Firehose 模式让您最大化上传训练数据，以改进 openpilot 的驾驶模型。数据越多，模型越大，实验模式也就越好。"

